### [​](https://docs.brightdata.com/api-reference/marketplace-dataset-api/deliver-snapshot#where-do-snapshot-ids-come-from)  Where do Snapshot IDs come from?
| Source | Endpoint | What it returns |
|-|-|-|
| [Trigger Collection](https://docs.brightdata.com/api-reference/rest-api/scraper/asynchronous-requests) | `POST``/datasets/v3/trigger` | `snapshot_id` in the response body |

```
curl -X POST "https://api.brightdata.com/datasets/v3/trigger?dataset_id=gd_l1viktl72bvl7bjuj0" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '[{"url": "https://example.com/product/123"}]'
```
